            "title": "Question: Appended at the end",
            "id": 82870,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Birleştirilmiş listede hangi liste önce görünecek?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"growth_rate_1 = [\" /><text value=\"0.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0.7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0.8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"growth_rate_2 = [\" /><text value=\"0.8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0.6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0.6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(growth_rate_1 + growth_rate_2)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[0.5, 0.7, 0.8, 0.8, 0.6, 0.6]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>growth_rate_1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>growth_rate_2</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">İkisi de, çünkü yeni listede öğeler rastgele karıştırılmış olacak</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>growth_rate_1</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>growth_rate_1</code> listesindeki üç değer neden <code>growth_rate_2</code> değerlerinden önce görünür?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"growth_rate_1 = [\" /><text value=\"0.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0.7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0.8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"growth_rate_2 = [\" /><text value=\"0.8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0.6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0.6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(growth_rate_1 + growth_rate_2)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[0.5, 0.7, 0.8, 0.8, 0.6, 0.6]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>growth_rate_1 + growth_rate_2</code> ifadesinde soldaki listenin değerleri önce yerleştirilir.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Python, ilk değeri daha küçük olan listeyi diğer listeden önce yerleştirir.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Birleştirilen listeler karıştırılır ve bu sıra rastgele oluşmuştur.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>growth_rate_1 + growth_rate_2</code> ifadesinde soldaki listenin değerleri önce yerleştirilir.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
