            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kodda yanlış olan ne?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"students_1 = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Kim&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"students_2 = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(students_1 + students_2)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['Anna', 16, 'Kim', 16, 'Joe', 17, 'Lee', 15]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kodda yanlış olan hiçbir şey yok</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Birden fazla tür içeren listeleri birleştiremeyiz</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Listelerde sayılar bulunamaz</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Kodda yanlış olan hiçbir şey yok.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu listeler birleştirildikten sonra yeni listenin <code>4</code> indeksinde hangi değer yer alır?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"students_1 = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Kim&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"students_2 = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(students_1 + students_2)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['Anna', 16, 'Kim', 16, 'Joe', 17, 'Lee', 15]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"Joe\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>16</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">String ve sayı içeren listeler birleştirilemediği için sonuç oluşmaz.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"Joe\"</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
