          {
            "title": "Question: Save in variable",
            "id": 82872,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>orders</code> değişkeni ne depolar?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"customers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jess&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mike&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lynn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"order_number = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"orders = customers + order_number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(orders)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['Jess', 'Mike', 'Lynn', 3, 1, 2]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[\"Jess\", \"Mike\", \"Lynn\", 3, 1, 2]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir sayı</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[3, 1, 2, \"Jess\", \"Mike\", \"Lynn\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>[\"Jess\", \"Mike\", \"Lynn\", 3, 1, 2]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>orders</code> oluşturulduktan sonra <code>orders[3]</code> bize ne verir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"customers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jess&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mike&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lynn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"order_number = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"orders = customers + order_number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(orders)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['Jess', 'Mike', 'Lynn', 3, 1, 2]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"Lynn\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code> indeksi ikinci listeye ait olduğu için hata verir</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>3</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Save in variable",
            "id": 82876,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İki listeyi, <code>day_1</code> ilk gelecek şekilde birleştir ve sonucu daha sonra kullanmak üzere <code>overview</code> değişkenine kaydet.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"day_1 = [\" /><text value=\"3.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"day_2 = [\" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"overview = day_1 + day_2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(overview)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[3.5, 2, 4, 7, 1]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>overview</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve sonra <code>day_1</code>, <code>+</code>, <code>day_2</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kodun <code>[3.5, 2, 4, 7, 1]</code> yazdırması için birleştirilen listeyi <code>overview</code> içinde sakla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"day_1 = [\" /><text value=\"3.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"day_2 = [\" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"overview = day_1 + day_2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(overview)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"day_1[0]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[3.5, 2, 4, 7, 1]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>overview</code>, ardından <code>=</code>, <code>day_1</code>, <code>+</code> ve son olarak <code>day_2</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Method call",
            "id": 82879,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu, konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"code = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(code.count(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"))\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[3, 0, 2, 2, 0, 1, 0]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>3</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdaki konsol, listenin mevcut hali için sonucu gösterir.</p><p><code>print</code> satırı çalışmadan önce <code>code</code> listesine bir <code>0</code> daha eklenseydi, bunun yerine ne görüntülerdi?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"code = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(code.count(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"))\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>4</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>count()</code> ilk listeyi kullandığı için <code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>count()</code> liste uzunluğunu döndürdüğü için <code>8</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>4</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Element to count",
            "id": 82880,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kodda yanlış olan ne?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"flavors = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;strawberry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(flavors.count())\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>count()</code> parantezlerinin arasında bir değer olmalı</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bu kodda yanlış olan hiçbir şey yok</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Liste çok uzun</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>count()</code> parantezlerinin arasında bir değer olmalı.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>count()</code> metodunun parantezleri arasında saymak istediğimiz değer olmalıdır.</p><p>Hangi satır <code>\"vanilla\"</code> değerinin kaç kez geçtiğini görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"flavors = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;strawberry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(flavors.count())\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>print(flavors.count(\"vanilla\"))</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(flavors.count())</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(flavors.count[\"vanilla\"])</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>print(flavors.count(\"vanilla\"))</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Boolean",
            "id": 88419,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu, konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"schedule = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;ballet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;swimming&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;running&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;ballet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;ballet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" schedule)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>True</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>False</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>True</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Üyelik kontrolü çalışmadan önce her iki <code>\"ballet\"</code> değeri de kaldırılırsa ne görüntülenir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"schedule = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;ballet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;swimming&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;running&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;ballet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;ballet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" schedule)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>False</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Üyelik eşleşme sayısını döndürdüğü için <code>0</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Aranan değer bulunmadığı için hata verir</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>False</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Reusing",
            "id": 82883,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod ne yapıyor?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"flavors = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;strawberry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"vanilla = flavors.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(vanilla)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"vanilla\"</code> öğelerinin sayısını bir değişkene kaydeder</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>flavors</code>'ın bir kopyasını oluşturur ve bunu bir değişkene kaydeder</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Hiçbir şey, kod yanlış</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"vanilla\"</code> öğelerinin sayısını bir değişkene kaydeder.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Atamadan önce bir <code>\"vanilla\"</code> değeri <code>\"chocolate\"</code> olarak değişirse <code>vanilla</code> ne saklar?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"flavors = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;strawberry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"vanilla = flavors.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(vanilla)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Değişken ilk sayıyı sakladığı için <code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Güncellenmiş <code>flavors</code> listesinin bir kopyasını</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>2</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
